"raw_url":"https://github.com/wongnai/xds/raw/075c9c035857e03f7c4fd75fe64fd06718ee6f88/clusterrole.yml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wongnai/xds/contents/clusterrole.yml?ref=075c9c035857e03f7c4fd75fe64fd06718ee6f88","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@\n+apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1\n+kind: ClusterRole\n+metadata:\n+  name: xds\n+rules:\n+  - apiGroups:\n+      - ''\n+    resources:\n+      - endpoints\n+      - services\n+    verbs:\n+      - get\n+      - list\n+      - watch"}]}